{"seq":2,"slug":"sla-metrics-ticket-measurement","title":"SLA 指标体系与工单度量：首响、解决时长、CSAT 与重开率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multilingual-cs-bpo-outsourcing/outsourcer-qa-sla/sla-metrics-ticket-measurement","wordCount":3333,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"sla-指标体系与工单度量-首响-解决时长-csat-与重开率\">SLA 指标体系与工单度量：首响、解决时长、CSAT 与重开率</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>外包合同里写的&quot;SLA&quot;几乎从不是单一数字，而是一组<strong>互相拉扯、必须成套解读</strong>的比率。把它们拆成孤立的考核项，是外包失效最常见的起点：只压首响（first response time, FRT），乙方就用模板群发一句&quot;我们已收到&quot;把计时归零；只压解决时长（resolution time），乙方就在时限前把工单标为已解决再靠客户重开；只压 CSAT，乙方就专挑情绪好的会话发问卷。任何<strong>单指标</strong>一旦被写成罚则，都会被最优回应策略绕过——这正是古德哈特定律（Goodhart&#39;s Law）在客服外包里的形态：当一个度量成为目标，它就不再是好的度量。</p>\n<p>因此第一原则是：<strong>指标集必须构成一组无法同时被低成本操纵的约束</strong>。速度类（首响、解决时长、AHT）配质量类（CSAT、FCR、重开率、质检分），再配过程类（升级准确率、知识库命中率），让&quot;压时间&quot;必然在&quot;质量&quot;上留下痕迹，反之亦然。ISO 18295-1:2017 把服务提供方应满足的要求与 ISO 18295-2:2017 规定的<strong>发包方</strong>要求分开（来源：iso.org），正说明指标设计是双方共同义务，而非甲方单方向乙方甩一张表。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[会话/工单进入] --&gt; B[首响 FRT:&lt;br/&gt;客户首条消息→坐席首次有效回复]&#10;  B --&gt; C[处理 AHT:&lt;br/&gt;通话+保持+事后整理]&#10;  C --&gt; D{一次解决?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[FCR 命中&lt;br/&gt;工单关闭]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[升级/转派&lt;br/&gt;升级准确率]&#10;  F --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; G[问卷触达&lt;br/&gt;CSAT/NPS 采样]&#10;  E --&gt; H[观察窗口内重开&lt;br/&gt;重开率 reopen rate]&#10;  G --&gt; I[质量维度]&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[质检抽检 + 知识库命中]&#10;  J --&gt; K[综合记分卡&lt;br/&gt;加权得分]\">graph TD\n  A[会话/工单进入] --&gt; B[首响 FRT:&lt;br/&gt;客户首条消息→坐席首次有效回复]\n  B --&gt; C[处理 AHT:&lt;br/&gt;通话+保持+事后整理]\n  C --&gt; D{一次解决?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[FCR 命中&lt;br/&gt;工单关闭]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[升级/转派&lt;br/&gt;升级准确率]\n  F --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; G[问卷触达&lt;br/&gt;CSAT/NPS 采样]\n  E --&gt; H[观察窗口内重开&lt;br/&gt;重开率 reopen rate]\n  G --&gt; I[质量维度]\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[质检抽检 + 知识库命中]\n  J --&gt; K[综合记分卡&lt;br/&gt;加权得分]</pre><p>上图的关键在 <code>E → H</code> 这条边：工单&quot;关闭&quot;不等于&quot;解决&quot;。重开率正是检验这条边的指标——它把 FCR 从坐席的自我声明，变回一个可被客户行为证伪的事实。下表先给出核心指标的口径对照，后续小节逐一展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>英文</th>\n<th>计时/采样口径</th>\n<th>典型考核区间</th>\n<th>可被操纵的方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首响时长</td>\n<td>FRT</td>\n<td>客户首条→首次<strong>有效</strong>回复</td>\n<td>邮件 &lt; 8h；聊天 &lt; 60s；社媒 &lt; 4h</td>\n<td>模板群发、空回复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均处理时长</td>\n<td>AHT</td>\n<td>通话+保持+事后整理</td>\n<td>因语言与渠道差异大</td>\n<td>挂断前置、缩短事后整理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解决时长</td>\n<td>Resolution Time</td>\n<td>建单→终态关闭（含等待客户时长）</td>\n<td>按优先级分层</td>\n<td>提前置为已解决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次解决率</td>\n<td>FCR</td>\n<td>观察窗内未重开/未再联系</td>\n<td>70%–85%</td>\n<td>拒绝重开、引导新单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重开率</td>\n<td>Reopen Rate</td>\n<td>关闭后 N 天内同问题重开</td>\n<td>&lt; 5%–10%</td>\n<td>强制新单规避重开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>满意度</td>\n<td>CSAT</td>\n<td>单次会话后 1–5 分量表</td>\n<td>75%–90% 满意率</td>\n<td>选择性发问卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净推荐值</td>\n<td>NPS</td>\n<td>0–10 推荐意愿</td>\n<td>因行业差异大</td>\n<td>样本偏置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质检分</td>\n<td>QA Score</td>\n<td>抽检评分卡</td>\n<td>内部阈值</td>\n<td>只挑好样本送检</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"首响与解决时长-计时口径决定一切\">首响与解决时长：计时口径决定一切</h2><p><strong>首响（FRT）</strong> 的争议几乎全部发生在&quot;什么叫首响&quot;。定义必须钉死三件事：起点、终点、有效回复的判据。起点是客户首条消息进入系统的时间戳，而非坐席看到它或排队分配完成的时间；终点是坐席发出的<strong>首次实质性回复</strong>，须包含对问题的回应或明确的下一步，而不是&quot;已收到，请稍候&quot;。把自动确认剔除出计时，是防止 FRT 被模板群发掏空的唯一办法。</p>\n<p>第二件事是<strong>营业时间 vs 自然时间</strong>。跨境外包横跨多时区：用自然时间计，乙方凌晨收到的工单会被天然判超时；用营业时间计，乙方又可通过缩短&quot;服务窗口&quot;美化数字。可行做法是<strong>服务窗口由甲方在合同中指定并与乙方排班绑定</strong>，窗口内按小时计、窗口外不计，但对 7×24 的 VIP 或纠纷工单另设自然时间口径。ISO 18295 系列要求服务提供方把服务时间与可达性写进服务规格（来源：iso.org），正是为了让这个口径没有解释空间。</p>\n<p><strong>解决时长（resolution time）</strong> 的陷阱在分子分母。它应包含<strong>等待客户回复的时间</strong>，否则会鼓励坐席抢先关闭；同时应<strong>排除真正的第三方阻塞</strong>（如等待支付网关或承运商），这类设为&quot;挂起（pending）&quot;并暂停计时。常见错误是把 AHT（坐席投入工时）当解决时长考核——AHT 衡量效率，解决时长衡量客户等待，目标相反：压 AHT 鼓励快速挂断，压解决时长鼓励一次讲完。跨境场景下 <strong>AHT 语言间不可比</strong>（同一句解释在中文与日语的产出量差数倍），用一套阈值横跨所有语种实际是在惩罚某些语言的坐席，应按语种设基线或用相对排名。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>FRT</mtext><mtext>compliant</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>有效首响</mtext><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>语言,渠道</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>总工单</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FRT}_{\\text{compliant}} = \\frac{\\#\\{\\text{有效首响} \\le T_{\\text{语言,渠道}}\\}}{\\#\\{\\text{总工单}\\}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FRT</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">compliant</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总工单</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效首响</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">语言</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">渠道</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>式中阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> <strong>按语言与渠道分别标定</strong>，这是把&quot;多语种不可比&quot;从口号落到公式里的方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"csat-与-nps-采样方式比分数本身更重要\">CSAT 与 NPS：采样方式比分数本身更重要</h2><p><strong>CSAT（客户满意度）</strong> 通常在单次会话后触达，用 1–5 分量表，取 4–5 分比例为&quot;满意率&quot;，测<strong>单次交互体验</strong>，天然带渠道偏差：聊天即时性拉高分数，异步邮件拉低，故只能同渠道同语言纵向看趋势。<strong>NPS（净推荐值）</strong> 由 Fred Reichheld 与 Bain &amp; Company、Satmetrix 于 2003 年提出，用 0–10 推荐意愿打分，推荐者（9–10）比例减贬损者（0–6）比例（来源：Bain &amp; Company / satmetrix.com），测<strong>关系型忠诚</strong>，适合季度测量而非日常考核——样本小、波动大，月度 NPS 扣罚几乎由噪声驱动。</p>\n<p>真正决定可信度的是<strong>采样</strong>。三条必须写进合同的纪律：<strong>抽样框覆盖全体会话</strong>而非&quot;满意坐席优先发送&quot;，由甲方 CRM/工单系统统一触发并抽检触发日志；<strong>跨语言量表校准</strong>，某些文化倾向避免极端选项会系统性压低两端分，用相对排名比绝对值更公允；<strong>响应率必须一并报告</strong>，未响应者体验往往更差，低响应率下 CSAT 被严重高估。合同应要求乙方同时报告触达量、回收量与响应率。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CSAT</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>∗</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CSAT} = \\frac{n*{4} + n*{5}}{n*{4} + n*{5} + n*{3} + n*{2} + n\\_{1}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CSAT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3174em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 较小时（小语种月度仅数十条），点估计不可靠，应改用<strong>置信区间下界</strong>考核或滚动三月合并样本，否则会在法语、泰语这类小语种上反复出现&quot;这个月 100%、下个月 40%&quot;的误判。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重开率与-fcr-把-已解决-交还给客户定义\">重开率与 FCR：把&quot;已解决&quot;交还给客户定义</h2><p>FCR（一次解决率）是外包最容易被注水的指标。它有两个口径：<strong>未重开口径</strong>（关闭后 N 天内未因同一问题重开）与<strong>未再联系口径</strong>（同一客户在窗口内未就同问题再次进线）。两者都会在乙方控制&quot;重开&quot;入口时被规避——最典型的是系统强制客户<strong>新建工单</strong>而不允许原单重开，重开率归零、FCR 虚高。</p>\n<p><strong>重开率（reopen rate）</strong> 因此必须独立考核，并明确规定：重开的<strong>判定归甲方系统</strong>（或双方共同可查的工单日志），窗口期为关闭后 3–7 天（纠纷类可延长至 14 天），同一问题跨渠道的再次进线也计入，无论它进了新单还是旧单。这样，&quot;压 FCR&quot;与&quot;压重开率&quot;就不再能被同一个动作同时满足。两者可用恒等式交叉验算乙方报表自洽性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>FCR</mtext><mtext>真实</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>R</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>closed</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FCR}_{\\text{真实}} \\approx 1 - \\frac{R}{N_{\\text{closed}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FCR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">真实</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">closed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>closed</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{closed}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">closed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为窗口内关闭工单数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 为被重开（含判定为同问题）的数。若乙方报出的 FCR 明显高于由重开率反推的值，说明口径不一致，应要求给出工单级明细。</p>\n<p>更深的陷阱是<strong>FCR 与解决时长负相关</strong>：为&quot;一次解决&quot;，坐席会把更多时间花在单次会话；为压解决时长，坐席会倾向快速收尾（抬高重开率）。这三个指标构成互斥三角，任何两个被写成硬罚则，第三个必然恶化。可行设计是<strong>把它们放进同一张加权记分卡</strong>，而非各自设独立扣款条款。</p>\n<h2 id=\"建一套可执行的-sla-记分卡与阈值\">建一套可执行的 SLA 记分卡与阈值</h2><p>把上面所有指标拼成一份合同附件，而不是散落在合同正文的零散条款里，是跨境外包治理的关键动作。一份可执行的记分卡要回答四个问题：<strong>权重、阈值、口径、罚则与豁免</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>权重设计遵循&quot;速度×质量×过程&quot;三类平衡</strong>。若速度类合计权重超过 60%，乙方会用各种方式换速度；建议速度类与质量类大致均衡（如各 40%），过程类占 20% 用于观测而非扣罚。复合得分可用下式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S = \\sum\\_{i} w_i \\cdot \\min\\!\\left(\\frac{m_i}{t_i},\\ \\frac{t_i}{m_i}\\right), \\quad \\sum_i w_i = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为实际值、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为目标值。用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min(m_i/t_i,\\ t_i/m_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 而非直接比值，是为了让<strong>双向偏离</strong>都受约束——否则乙方会牺牲质量项、把某一项做到 200% 拉总分会。对 CSAT 这类越大越好的指标，只取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m_i/t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 并设单向上限。</p>\n<p><strong>阈值采用分级而非单点</strong>：设&quot;目标值（target）&quot;与&quot;最低可接受值（floor）&quot;，达标拿满分，介于两者按比例计分，跌破 floor 触发整改或罚则。下表是可直接套用的记分卡骨架（数值需按语种与渠道基线校准）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>最低可接受</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>罚则触发</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>FRT（聊天）</td>\n<td>≤ 60s</td>\n<td>≤ 120s</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>连续两月跌破 floor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>FRT（邮件）</td>\n<td>≤ 8h</td>\n<td>≤ 16h</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>解决时长（P2）</td>\n<td>≤ 24h</td>\n<td>≤ 48h</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>CSAT 满意率</td>\n<td>≥ 85%</td>\n<td>≥ 75%</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n<td>服务抵扣</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>FCR</td>\n<td>≥ 80%</td>\n<td>≥ 70%</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>重开率</td>\n<td>≤ 5%</td>\n<td>≤ 10%</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过程</td>\n<td>质检分</td>\n<td>≥ 90</td>\n<td>≥ 80</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>整改通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过程</td>\n<td>升级准确率</td>\n<td>≥ 95%</td>\n<td>≥ 90%</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>观测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>口径必须写进附件</strong>：每条指标注明起点、终点、是否含等待、是否含挂起、关闭后重开窗口、营业时间定义、语言与渠道基线。这一栏的文字量应远大于数字本身——纠纷几乎都源于口径而非数值。</p>\n<p><strong>豁免与排除项</strong>同样要写清：平台级故障（支付渠道宕机、物流疫情中断）导致的大量工单、恶意刷单与欺诈工单、甲方知识库错误导致的批量误答，应从考核中剔除，并规定举证方式。COPC 客户体验标准把质量、知识、技术与供应商治理纳入统一评估框架（来源：copc.com），其逻辑正是要求指标背后的<strong>根因归属</strong>可被追踪，而不是把所有偏差都记在乙方头上。</p>\n<p>最后一条纪律：<strong>记分卡要绑定动作</strong>。达标如何续约、长期超标如何分成、跌破 floor 如何整改与抵扣，都应事先约定；没有动作的记分卡只是报表，乙方的最优回应是解释而非改进。跨境外包交接地的时区与文化差异会让&quot;整改&quot;落地更慢，故罚则与整改通知应设明确时限与升级路径，例如首次跌破给 30 天整改期、再次跌破启动服务抵扣。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>单指标必被操纵</strong>：写成罚则的指标会被最优回应策略绕过（古德哈特定律），指标集必须让&quot;压时间&quot;在&quot;质量&quot;上留下痕迹。</li>\n<li><strong>口径决定一切</strong>：FRT 的&quot;有效回复&quot;、解决时长是否含等待与挂起、重开的判定归属与窗口期，纠纷几乎都出在这些定义上。</li>\n<li><strong>跨语言不可直接比</strong>：AHT、CSAT、量表校准都要按语种设基线或用相对排名，否则是在惩罚特定语言的坐席。</li>\n<li><strong>采样比打分更重要</strong>：CSAT/NPS 的抽样框须由甲方统一触发并同时报告响应率；小语种样本看置信区间下界。</li>\n<li><strong>FCR 与重开率互为验算</strong>：用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>closed</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - R/N_{\\text{closed}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">closed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 交叉核对乙方报表自洽性，防&quot;强制新单&quot;规避。</li>\n<li><strong>互斥三角要放进同一记分卡</strong>：速度、解决时长、重开率不能各自设独立罚则，应由加权得分统一约束双向偏离。</li>\n<li><strong>可对齐的管理语言</strong>：ISO 18295-1/-2:2017 区分服务提供方与发包方义务（来源：iso.org）；COPC CX Standard 将质量与供应商治理纳入统一框架（来源：copc.com）；记分卡须绑定目标值/floor 分级、豁免举证、整改时限与升级路径。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>延伸阅读：本章的工单数据一旦按上述口径沉淀，即可作为「外包数据度量的韧性」章节中指标异常检测与数据质量校验的输入；指标本身的服务边界则回到「外包启用蓝图」中定义的 SOP 与升级矩阵——指标是流程的影子，流程不稳，指标只会放大噪声。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SLA 指标体系与工单度量：首响、解决时长、CSAT 与重开率","id":"sla-指标体系与工单度量-首响-解决时长-csat-与重开率"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"首响与解决时长：计时口径决定一切","id":"首响与解决时长-计时口径决定一切"},{"level":2,"text":"CSAT 与 NPS：采样方式比分数本身更重要","id":"csat-与-nps-采样方式比分数本身更重要"},{"level":2,"text":"重开率与 FCR：把\"已解决\"交还给客户定义","id":"重开率与-fcr-把-已解决-交还给客户定义"},{"level":2,"text":"建一套可执行的 SLA 记分卡与阈值","id":"建一套可执行的-sla-记分卡与阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多语种质检方法与评分卡设计（AI 抽检 + 人工复核）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multilingual-cs-bpo-outsourcing/outsourcer-qa-sla/multilingual-qa-scorecard-design"},"next":{"title":"争议工单、升级路径与 SLA 罚则 / 赔付结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/multilingual-cs-bpo-outsourcing/outsourcer-qa-sla/dispute-escalation-penalty-settlement"}}